OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests after man found
OL,4,Adead in property
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after another man
OL,8,Fwas found dead.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Ffound the victim, believed to be a man
OL,12,Fin his 50s, inside a property on
OL,13,FBaytree Hill in Liskeard at about 21:30
OL,14,FBST on Sunday.
OL,16,FIt said a local man in his 30s was
OL,17,Farrested at the scene and further
OL,18,Finvestigations led to the arrests of
OL,19,Ftwo other local men in their 40s and
OL,20,F50s, and a man in his 20s from
OL,21,FPlymouth. All remained in custody, it
OL,22,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
